BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ie-paye-payment-monthly@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=14
SUMMARY:Ireland: PAYE\, PRSI and USC payment to Revenue (monthly remitters)
DESCRIPTION:Monthly remitters pay the total liability within 14 days after 
 the end of each month. The employer accepts the monthly statement by the 1
 4th of the following month.\nApplies to: Employers remitting monthly who d
 o not use the ROS extension\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSo
 urce: https://www.revenue.ie/en/employing-people/paying-your-employees-tax
 -to-revenue/paying-tax-to-revenue.aspx\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpa
 yroll.eu/deadlines.html#ireland\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax
  advice. Dates follow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends a
 nd holidays are not applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#ireland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ie-paye-payment-monthly-ros@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261024
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=23
SUMMARY:Ireland: PAYE\, PRSI and USC payment to Revenue (monthly\, ROS exte
 nsion)
DESCRIPTION:The payment deadline extends to 23 days after the end of the mo
 nth if the employer files the return and pays the tax on the Revenue Onlin
 e Service (ROS).\nApplies to: Monthly remitters who file and pay through R
 OS\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://www.revenue
 .ie/en/employing-people/paying-your-employees-tax-to-revenue/paying-tax-to
 -revenue.aspx\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#i
 reland\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the
  recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are not appli
 ed. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#ireland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ie-paye-payment-quarterly@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=3;BYMONTHDAY=14
SUMMARY:Ireland: PAYE\, PRSI and USC payment to Revenue (quarterly remitter
 s)
DESCRIPTION:Quarterly remitters pay by 14 April\, 14 July\, 14 October and 
 14 January (23rd of the same months with the ROS extension). Quarterly rem
 itting is for employers with yearly payments of EUR 28\,800 or less who ap
 ply.\nApplies to: Employers approved to remit quarterly (yearly PAYE\, PRS
 I and USC of EUR 28\,800 or less)\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.
 \n\nSource: https://www.revenue.ie/en/employing-people/paying-your-employe
 es-tax-to-revenue/paying-tax-to-revenue.aspx\nDetails: https://www.intelli
 gentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#ireland\n\nFor information only\, not legal 
 or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring rule stated by the source\; week
 ends and holidays are not applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#ireland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
